eam/apps/2354070/extras/c677abb828f8e1576e3feae967eb36f8.avif?t=1710860015\" /></span><br><br>-Computer-<br>You can play various mini-games from the computer in your gallery, and you can also make various expenses that may be useful for your gallery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354070/extras/9edbb5c2a4f82fbdb20d5eb7198b639c.avif?t=1710860015\" /></span>",
